// Curated example programs (from src/test-programs/, plus a welcome
// tour). Inlined as strings so the app is fully self-contained.
// Multi-file entries ({files, entry}) are module programs
// (docs/MODULES.md). Examples use the gradual type system: programs
// in an object language are written over its concrete s-expression
// syntax and typed by define-grammar (docs/GRAMMARS.md) -- no parser
// or printer layer -- and other data by define-type, whose
// constructors build plain s-expressions too. Every entry runs
// identically under the web interpreter and the hosted reference
// (which also typechecks it).

